### Install the "REST Client" extension in VS Code, then click "Send Request"
### above each block below. Run these top to bottom in order.

@host = http://localhost:8080/api/chromeos

### 0. Check current status (should be "disconnected" on a fresh run)
GET {{host}}/status

### 1. Generate credentials (fully automated step)
POST {{host}}/connect/init

### 2. Poll for admin authorization (mock auto-authorizes here)
GET {{host}}/connect/status

### 3. Finish - starts the background sync worker
POST {{host}}/connect/finish

### 4. Wait ~2 seconds after step 3, then check status (should be "active")
GET {{host}}/status

### 5. List synced devices
GET {{host}}/devices

### 6. Run a remote action - copy a real "id" from step 5's response first
POST {{host}}/devices/action?id=REPLACE_WITH_DEVICE_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "restart"
}

### 7. Check the action - copy the "id" from step 6's response
GET {{host}}/actions?id=REPLACE_WITH_ACTION_ID

### 8. Reset back to a clean disconnected state
POST {{host}}/disconnect
